1. install nginx and start it in amazon linxu 2023
2. configure two virtual hosts with two different domains
   1. xyz.<yourname>.ducksdns.org  served from /usr/share/nginx/pythonapp  (index.html < hello from python app )
   2. example.<yourname>.ducksdns.org served from /usr/share/nginx/rubyapp (index.html < hello from ruby app )
4. nginx -t 
5. systemctl reload ngnix
